  "Wrapped BTC exposure — borrowed to short BTC against blue-chip LPs.":
    "封装 BTC 敞口 — 用于借入以对蓝筹 LP 做空 BTC。",
  "USDC listed day-1 with 80% borrow cap.": "USDC 于第 1 天上架，借款上限为 80%。",
  "Simulated 2023-style de-peg; guardrails paused borrows for 18m.": "模拟了 2023 年式脱锚；防护机制暂停借款 18m。",
  "Supply cap raised to $250M after utilization sustained >75% for 30 days.":
    "在利用率持续 >75% 达 30 天后，供应上限上调至 $250M。",
  "Guardrails pause borrows on >50bps Chainlink deviation for 5m.":
    "若 Chainlink 偏差 >50bps 持续 5m，防护机制将暂停借款。",
  "Weekly Circle attestations ingested into the oracle pipeline.": "每周将 Circle 证明摄入预言机管线。",
  "Canonical bridge only; non-canonical deployments are blocked.": "仅限规范桥；非规范部署将被阻止。",
  "Standard ERC-20 implementation.": "标准 ERC-20 实现。",
  "Ethereum is a decentralized blockchain with smart contract functionality. Ether is the native cryptocurrency of the platform and is used to pay for transaction fees and computational services on the network. It is the second-largest cryptocurrency by market capitalization and powers the majority of decentralized finance activity.":
    "Ethereum 是具备智能合约功能的去中心化区块链。Ether 是该平台的原生加密货币，用于支付网络上的交易费用与计算服务。它是按市值计第二大加密货币，为大多数去中心化金融活动提供动力。",
  "Ethereum genesis block mined.": "Ethereum 创世区块被挖出。",
  "Proof-of-stake consensus activated.": "已启用权益证明（PoS）共识。",
  "Quarterly risk review — no changes.": "季度风险审查 — 无变更。",
  "USDC is the benchmark stable. Depeg tail is the dominant risk; monitored by deviation guards and Circle attestations.":
    "USDC 是基准稳定币。脱锚尾部是主要风险；由偏差防护与 Circle 证明进行监控。",
